"following code can be used:"
msgstr "例如，要在仿真世界中生成静止的球体，可使用以下代码："

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:43
msgid "Rigid object"
msgstr "刚体对象"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:45
msgid ""
"Rigid objects (i.e. object only has a single body) can be made static by "
"setting the parameter :attr:`sim.schemas.RigidBodyBaseCfg.kinematic_enabled`"
" as True. This will make the object kinematic: its motion is prescribed by "
"user code rather than integrated from gravity and forces. Without prescribed"
" motion, it stays fixed. It can still participate in collisions."
msgstr ""
"刚性物体（只包含一个刚体的物体）可通过将 :attr:`sim.schemas.RigidBodyBaseCfg.kinematic_enabled` "
"设为 True 来保持静止。这样会将物体设为运动学物体：其运动由用户代码指定，而不是根据重力和力进行积分。如果未指定运动，它就保持固定，但仍可参与碰撞。"

