msgid ""
"For instance, to spawn a sphere static in the simulation world but with "
"rigid body schema on it, the following code can be used:"
msgstr "例如，要在仿真世界中生成具有刚体模式的静止球体，可使用以下代码："

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:70
msgid "Articulation"
msgstr "关节体"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:72
msgid ""
"Fixing the root of an articulation requires having a fixed joint to the root"
" rigid body link of the articulation. This can be achieved by setting the "
"parameter :attr:`sim.schemas.ArticulationRootBaseCfg.fix_root_link` as True."
" Based on the value of this parameter, the following cases are possible:"
msgstr ""
"固定关节体的根，需要在关节体的根刚体连杆上设置固定关节。可将 "
":attr:`sim.schemas.ArticulationRootBaseCfg.fix_root_link` 设为 True "
"来实现。根据此参数的值，可能出现以下情况："

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:76
msgid "If set to :obj:`None`, the root link is not modified."
msgstr "设为 :obj:`None` 时，不修改根连杆。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:77
msgid ""
"If the articulation already has a fixed root link, this flag will enable or "
"disable the fixed joint."
msgstr "如果关节体已有固定根连杆，此标志会启用或禁用对应的固定关节。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:78
msgid ""
"If the articulation does not have a fixed root link, this flag will create a"
" fixed joint between the world frame and the root link, under a writable "
"prim in the asset hierarchy."
msgstr "如果关节体没有固定根连杆，此标志会在世界坐标系与根连杆之间创建固定关节，并将其放在资产层级中的可写 prim 下。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:81
msgid ""
"For instance, to spawn an ANYmal robot and fix its base while leaving its "
"joints movable, the following code can be used:"
msgstr "例如，要生成 ANYmal 机器人并固定其基座，同时保持关节可动，可使用以下代码："

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:98
msgid ""
"This creates a fixed joint between the world frame and the root link of the "
"ANYmal robot. The joint is authored under a writable prim; its exact path "
"depends on the asset's root and instancing layout."
msgstr "这会在世界坐标系与 ANYmal 机器人的根连杆之间创建固定关节。该关节写入可写 prim 下，具体路径取决于资产根节点和实例化布局。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:102
msgid ""
"For a spawn configuration using schema fragments, or no "
"``articulation_props``, set ``UsdFileCfg(fix_root_link=True, ...)`` instead."
" When using a legacy properties configuration as above, keep "
"``fix_root_link`` on that configuration. Both paths author the fixed joint "
"before the backend imports the articulation."
msgstr ""
"如果生成配置使用模式片段，或没有 ``articulation_props`` ，则改为设置 "
"``UsdFileCfg(fix_root_link=True, ...)`` 。使用上述传统属性配置时，应在该属性配置上保留 "
"``fix_root_link`` 。两种方式都会在后端导入关节体前写入固定关节。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:0
msgid "PhysX articulation-root placement details"
msgstr "PhysX 关节体根的位置细节"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:111
msgid ""
"The following parser details explain the PhysX-specific root-placement "
"adjustment. Newton imports the resulting USD joint topology; do not apply "
"PhysX parser heuristics as Newton configuration rules."
msgstr ""
"以下解析器细节说明了 PhysX 专用的根位置调整。Newton 会导入最终得到的 USD 关节拓扑；不要将 PhysX 解析器的启发式规则当作 "
"Newton 配置规则。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:115
msgid ""
"Given the flexibility of USD asset designing the following possible "
"scenarios are usually encountered:"
msgstr "USD 资产的组织方式较为灵活，常见情况如下："

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:117
msgid ""
"**Articulation root schema on the rigid body prim without a fixed joint**:"
msgstr "**关节体根模式应用于刚体 prim，且没有固定关节** ："

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:119
msgid ""
"This is the most common and recommended scenario for floating-base "
"articulations. The root prim has both the rigid body and the articulation "
"root properties. In this case, the articulation root is parsed as a "
"floating-base with the root prim of the articulation ``Link0Xform``."
msgstr ""
"这是浮动基座关节体最常见、也最推荐的组织方式。根 prim 同时具有刚体属性和关节体根属性，解析得到的关节体为浮动基座系统，其根 prim 是 "
"``Link0Xform`` 。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:128
msgid "**Articulation root schema on the parent prim with a fixed joint**:"
msgstr "**关节体根模式应用于父 prim，且存在固定关节** ："

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:130
msgid ""
"This is the expected arrangement for fixed-base articulations. The root prim"
" has only the rigid body properties and the articulation root properties are"
" applied to its parent prim. In this case, the articulation root is parsed "
"as a fixed-base with the root prim of the articulation ``Link0Xform``."
msgstr ""
"这是固定基座关节体的预期组织方式。根 prim 仅具有刚体属性，关节体根属性应用于其父 prim。解析得到的关节体为固定基座系统，其根 prim 是 "
"``Link0Xform`` 。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:140
msgid "**Articulation root schema on the parent prim without a fixed joint**:"
msgstr "**关节体根模式应用于父 prim，且没有固定关节** ："

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:142
msgid ""
"This is a scenario where the root prim has only the rigid body properties "
"and the articulation root properties are applied to its parent prim. "
"However, the fixed joint is not created between the world frame and the root"
" link. In this case, the articulation is parsed as a floating-base system. "
"However, the PhysX parser uses its own heuristic (such as alphabetical "
"order) to determine the root prim of the articulation. It may select the "
"root prim at ``Link0Xform`` or choose another prim as the root prim."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，根 prim 仅具有刚体属性，关节体根属性应用于其父 "
"prim，但世界坐标系与根连杆之间没有固定关节。关节体会被解析为浮动基座系统。PhysX 解析器使用自身的启发式规则（如字母顺序）确定关节体的根 "
"prim，因此可能选中 ``Link0Xform`` ，也可能选中其他 prim。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:153
msgid ""
"**Articulation root schema on the rigid body prim with a fixed joint**:"
msgstr "**关节体根模式应用于刚体 prim，且存在固定关节** ："

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:155
msgid ""
"While this is a valid scenario, it is not recommended as it may lead to "
"unexpected behavior. In this case, the articulation is still parsed as a "
"floating-base system. However, the fixed joint, created between the world "
"frame and the root link, is considered as a part of the maximal coordinate "
"tree. This is different from PhysX considering the articulation as a fixed-"
"base system. Hence, the simulation may not behave as expected."
msgstr ""
"这种组织方式虽有效，但可能产生意外行为，因此不推荐。关节体仍会被解析为浮动基座系统，而世界坐标系与根连杆之间的固定关节被视为最大坐标树的一部分。这与 "
"PhysX 将整个关节体解析为固定基座系统的方式不同，因此仿真结果可能不符合预期。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:166
msgid ""
"For floating base articulations, the root prim usually has both the rigid "
"body and the articulation root properties. However, directly connecting this"
" prim to the world frame will cause the simulation to consider the fixed "
"joint as a part of the maximal coordinate tree. This is different from PhysX"
" considering the articulation as a fixed-base system."
msgstr ""
"浮动基座关节体的根 prim 通常同时具有刚体属性和关节体根属性。若直接将该 prim "
"固定到世界坐标系，仿真会把固定关节视为最大坐标树的一部分，而不会让 PhysX 将整个关节体视为固定基座系统。"

#: source/how-to/make_fixed_prim.rst:171
msgid ""
"Internally, when the parameter "
":attr:`sim.schemas.ArticulationRootBaseCfg.fix_root_link` is set to True and"
" the articulation is detected as a floating-base system, the fixed joint is "
"created between the world frame the root rigid body link of the "
"articulation. However, to make the PhysX parser consider the articulation as"
" a fixed-base system, the articulation root properties are removed from the "
"root rigid body prim and applied to its parent prim instead."
msgstr ""
"内部实现中，当 :attr:`sim.schemas.ArticulationRootBaseCfg.fix_root_link` 设为 "
"True，且关节体被识别为浮动基座系统时，会在世界坐标系与关节体根刚体连杆之间创建固定关节。不过，为使 PhysX "
"解析器将关节体视为固定基座系统，会从根刚体 prim 移除关节体根属性，并将其应用到父 prim。"
